    "type": "question",
    "label": "60",
    "prompt": "Solve the following equations simultaneously for $x$ and $y$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}3^{x+2y}&=81\\\\2^{2x-y}&=8\\end{aligned}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=2$, $y=1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^{x+2y}&=3^4\\\\2^{2x-y}&=2^3\\\\x+2y&=4\\\\2x-y&=3\\end{align*}$$\nAdd the first linear equation to twice the second.\n$$\\begin{align*}(x+2y)+2(2x-y)&=4+2(3)\\\\5x&=10\\\\x&=2\\\\2+2y&=4\\\\2y&=2\\\\y&=1\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
